item.tinkersgadgets.boomerang.name=Boomerang
item.tinkersgadgets.boomerang.desc=A returning thrown weapon.§r\nRight-click: Charge to throw. Returns after impact.
item.tinkersgadgets.throwing_knife.name=Throwing Knife
item.tinkersgadgets.throwing_knife.desc=A throwable knife with moderate damage.\nRight-click: short charge to throw one.\nSneak + right-click: long charge to fan three blades.
modifier.boomerang_piercing.name=Piercing
modifier.boomerang_piercing.desc=§oClean through!§r\nBoomerang pierces up to 2 additional enemies.
modifier.bouncing_boomerang.name=Bouncing
modifier.bouncing_boomerang.desc=§oBoing! Boing!§r\nBoomerang bounces between nearby enemies.
modifier.return_damage.name=Return Damage
modifier.return_damage.desc=§oWatch your back!§r\nBoomerang deals damage on its return flight.
modifier.fracture_boomerang.name=Fracture
modifier.fracture_boomerang.desc=§oHandle with care!§r\nBoomerang splits into two shards on impact, each dealing reduced damage.
modifier.keen.name=Hooked Blade
modifier.keen.desc=§oCan't shake it off!§r\nBoomerang latches onto targets, dealing continuous damage.
modifier.collection_boomerang.name=Collection
modifier.collection_boomerang.desc=§oGather 'round!§r\nCollects nearby items during flight.
modifier.interact_boomerang.name=Interactive
modifier.interact_boomerang.desc=§oPush the right buttons!§r\nSimulates right-click on block impact.
modifier.deflect_boomerang.name=Deflect
modifier.deflect_boomerang.desc=§oStay back!§r\nKnocks away incoming projectiles while in flight.
modifier.instant_return_boomerang.name=Instant Return
modifier.instant_return_boomerang.desc=§oBack in a flash!§r\nBoomerang returns instantly after striking an enemy.
modifier.rebound_throwingknife.name=Rebound
modifier.rebound_throwingknife.desc=§oElastic!§r\nKnife has a chance to bounce off targets and drop, allowing recovery.
modifier.recovery_throwingknife.name=Recovery
modifier.recovery_throwingknife.desc=§oRight back at you!§r\nAutomatically returns after hitting a block.
modifier.shatter_boomerang.name=Shatter
modifier.shatter_boomerang.desc=§oBits and pieces!§r\nShatters soft blocks on impact.
modifier.echo_throwingknife.name=Echo
modifier.echo_throwingknife.desc=§oResonating echo!§r\nSwitching targets deals bonus damage to the previous one, with consecutive switches increasing the damage dealt.
modifier.pulse_throwingknife.name=Pulse
modifier.pulse_throwingknife.desc=§oHigh-frequency pulse!§r\nSignificantly reduces invincibility frames after being hit.
modifier.guidance_throwingknife.name=Guidance
modifier.guidance_throwingknife.desc=§oNever miss!§r\nKnives slightly home in on nearby targets.
modifier.trauma_throwingknife.name=Trauma
modifier.trauma_throwingknife.desc=§oWounds deepen!§r\nConsecutive hits on the same target deal increasing damage.
modifier.inertia_throwingknife.name=Inertia
modifier.inertia_throwingknife.desc=§oHeavy strike!§r\nKnives deal more damage but are heavier in flight.
modifier.pressurized_heatraygun.name=Pressurized
modifier.pressurized_heatraygun.desc=§oPressure builds!§r\nMore fuel means more damage.
modifier.temper_heatraygun.name=Temper
modifier.temper_heatraygun.desc=§oForged in fire!§r\nNext hit after overheating deals double damage.
modifier.thermostatic_heatraygun.name=Thermostatic
modifier.thermostatic_heatraygun.desc=§oJust right!§r\nDamage scales with heat proximity to the midpoint; penalties at both extremes.
modifier.condensation_heatraygun.name=Condensation
modifier.condensation_heatraygun.desc=§oCool down!§r\nGradually reduces heat over time.
modifier.focus_heatraygun.name=Focus
modifier.focus_heatraygun.desc=§oFull power ahead!§r\nDamage scales with heat.
modifier.capacity_heatraygun.name=Capacity
modifier.capacity_heatraygun.desc=§oBigger tank!§r\nAdds 2000 fuel capacity per level.
modifier.rapid_heatraygun.name=Rapid
modifier.rapid_heatraygun.desc=§oSugar rush!§r\nIncreases fire rate by 10% per level.
modifier.power_heatraygun.name=Power
modifier.power_heatraygun.desc=§oBlazing fury!§r\nIncreases damage by 10% per level.
modifier.efficiency_heatraygun.name=Efficiency
modifier.efficiency_heatraygun.desc=§oRecycle and reuse!§r\nIncreases fuel efficiency by 15% per level.
modifier.burst_heatraygun.name=Resonate
modifier.burst_heatraygun.desc=§oSorry, not sorry!§r\nSplash damage to nearby enemies on hit.
modifier.conduction_heatraygun.name=Conduction
modifier.conduction_heatraygun.desc=§oFlammable and delicious!§r\nWhile on fire, extra heat consumption grants a significant damage boost.
